    "en": "“It isn’t that you ‘cannot die.’ You will simply continue, changing form, as the universe does.”",
    "ja": "「了解。今日は、その前提から始めよう」\nNei-chan『タマ、いま皮肉の温度が下がった。たぶん、怖いの』"
